      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "         Familie: Umbelliferae Juss. Unterfamilie: Orthospermae Juss.                                       Tribus: Oumineae Koch.\n  Gattung: (uminum L.                                                                                                      i",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "隕形科，Orthospermae亞科，Oumineae族，Cuminum屬。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
